{"suttaId":"sn35.107","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iv","vriCode":"s0304m.mul","paras":[656,657],"vripara":"107"},"segments":{"sn35.107:0.3":"Lokasamudayasuttaṃ","sn35.107:1.1":"“Lokassa, bhikkhave, samudayañca atthaṅgamañca desessāmi.","sn35.107:1.2":"Taṃ suṇātha.","sn35.107:1.3":"Katamo ca, bhikkhave, lokassa samudayo?","sn35.107:1.4":"Cakkhuñca paṭicca rūpe ca uppajjati cakkhuviññāṇaṃ. Tiṇṇaṃ saṅgati phasso.","sn35.107:1.5":"Phassapaccayā vedanā;","sn35.107:1.6":"vedanāpaccayā taṇhā;","sn35.107:1.7":"taṇhāpaccayā upādānaṃ;","sn35.107:1.8":"upādānapaccayā bhavo;","sn35.107:1.9":"bhavapaccayā jāti;","sn35.107:1.10":"jātipaccayā jarāmaraṇaṃ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā sambhavanti.","sn35.107:1.11":"Ayaṃ kho, bhikkhave, lokassa samudayo … pe …","sn35.107:1.12":"jivhañca paṭicca rase ca uppajjati jivhāviññāṇaṃ … pe …","sn35.107:1.13":"manañca paṭicca dhamme ca uppajjati manoviññāṇaṃ. Tiṇṇaṃ saṅgati phasso.","sn35.107:1.14":"Phassapaccayā vedanā;","sn35.107:1.15":"vedanāpaccayā taṇhā;","sn35.107:1.16":"taṇhāpaccayā upādānaṃ;","sn35.107:1.17":"upādānapaccayā bhavo;","sn35.107:1.18":"bhavapaccayā jāti;","sn35.107:1.19":"jātipaccayā jarāmaraṇaṃ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā sambhavanti.","sn35.107:1.20":"Ayaṃ kho, bhikkhave, lokassa samudayo.","sn35.107:2.1":"“Katamo ca, bhikkhave, lokassa atthaṅgamo?","sn35.107:2.2":"Cakkhuñca paṭicca rūpe ca uppajjati cakkhuviññāṇaṃ. Tiṇṇaṃ saṅgati phasso.","sn35.107:2.3":"Phassapaccayā vedanā;","sn35.107:2.4":"vedanāpaccayā taṇhā.","sn35.107:2.5":"Tassāyeva taṇhāya asesavirāganirodhā upādānanirodho;","sn35.107:2.6":"upādānanirodhā bhavanirodho;","sn35.107:2.7":"bhavanirodhā jātinirodho;","sn35.107:2.8":"jātinirodhā jarāmaraṇaṃ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā nirujjhanti.","sn35.107:2.9":"Evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa nirodho hoti.","sn35.107:2.10":"Ayaṃ kho, bhikkhave, lokassa atthaṅgamo … pe …","sn35.107:2.11":"jivhañca paṭicca rase ca uppajjati … pe …","sn35.107:2.12":"manañca paṭicca dhamme ca uppajjati manoviññāṇaṃ. Tiṇṇaṃ saṅgati phasso.","sn35.107:2.13":"Phassapaccayā vedanā;","sn35.107:2.14":"vedanāpaccayā taṇhā.","sn35.107:2.15":"Tassāyeva taṇhāya asesavirāganirodhā upādānanirodho;","sn35.107:2.16":"upādānanirodhā … pe …","sn35.107:2.17":"evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa nirodho hoti.","sn35.107:2.18":"Ayaṃ kho, bhikkhave, lokassa atthaṅgamo”ti.","sn35.107:2.19":"Catutthaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0304a.att","from":190,"to":193,"paras":[{"para":190,"vripara":"105-113","refs":["sn35.107:1"],"lines":["105-113. Dutiye vedanāsukhadukkhaṃ kathitaṃ, taṃ pana vipākasukhadukkhaṃ vaṭṭati.","Tatiye <b>dukkhassā</b>ti vaṭṭadukkhassa.","Catutthe <b>lokassā</b>ti saṅkhāralokassa.","Pañcamādīsu yaṃ vattabbaṃ siyā, taṃ khandhiyavagge vuttanayameva."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.107:1"],["sn35.107:1"],["sn35.107:1"],["sn35.107:1"]]},{"para":191,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.107:1"],"lines":["Yogakkhemivaggo ekādasamo."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.107:1"]]},{"para":192,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.107:1"],"lines":["Lokakāmaguṇavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.107:1"]]},{"para":193,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.107:1"],"lines":["1-2. Paṭhamamārapāsasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.107:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0304t.tik","from":196,"to":200,"paras":[{"para":196,"vripara":"105-113","refs":["sn35.107:1"],"lines":["105-113. <b>Vedanāsukhadukkhan</b>ti vedanāsaṅkhātaṃ sukhañca dukkhañca kathitaṃ.","“Ajjhattaṃ sukhaṃ dukkhan”ti vuttattā vimuttisukhassa ca saḷāyatanadukkhassa ca kathitattā vivaṭṭasukhaṃ cettha kathitamevāti sakkā viññātuṃ.","Kāmaṃ khandhiyavagge khandhavasena desanā āgatā, na āyatanavasena.","Ettha pana vattabbaṃ atthajātaṃ khandhiyavagge vuttanayamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.107:1"],["sn35.107:1"],["sn35.107:1"],["sn35.107:1"]]},{"para":197,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.107:1"],"lines":["Upādāyasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.107:1"]]},{"para":198,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.107:1"],"lines":["Yogakkhemivaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.107:1"]]},{"para":199,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.107:1"],"lines":["Lokakāmaguṇavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.107:1"]]},{"para":200,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.107:1"],"lines":["1-2. Paṭhamamārapāsasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.107:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
